  "year two, the same cycle coming round again": "jaar twee, dieselfde siklus wat weer omkom",
  "Plan to transplant {crop} in {entry}. Start checking seedlings in {start}; if they are still not ready by {latest}, update the plan instead of treating the bed as occupied.": "Beplan om {crop} in {entry} oor te plant. Begin saailinge in {start} nagaan; as hulle teen {latest} steeds nie gereed is nie, werk die plan by eerder as om die bedding as beset te behandel.",
  "Plan to transplant {crop} in {entry}": "Beplan om {crop} in {entry} oor te plant",
  "Twelve dots = Jan to Dec. Green marks the months you can sow that crop in this site's rainfall pattern.": "Twaalf kolletjies = Jan tot Des. Groen merk die maande waarin jy daardie gewas in hierdie terrein se reënvalpatroon kan saai.",
  "Space-hungry — wants its own bed": "Ruimtevretend — wil sy eie bedding hê",
  "space-hungry": "ruimtevretend",
  "exact sow-to-finish timing is not verified": "presiese tydsberekening van saai tot klaar is nie geverifieer nie",
  "{duration} to flowering, then cut or roll down": "{duration} tot blom, dan sny of rol plat",
  "{duration} from transplant to harvest": "{duration} van oorplant tot oes",
  "{duration} from sowing to harvest": "{duration} van saai tot oes",
  "Usual picking period: {period}; the plan keeps the bed occupied through the upper end unless you finish it earlier.": "Gewone plukperiode: {period}; die plan hou die bedding beset tot by die boonste grens, tensy jy dit vroeër klaarmaak.",
  "{crop} wants room to spread — best in its own dedicated bed rather than shared or split with other crops.": "{crop} wil ruimte hê om uit te sprei — die beste in sy eie toegewyde bedding eerder as gedeel of verdeel met ander gewasse.",
  "Variety / cultivar (optional)": "Variëteit / kultivar (opsioneel)",
  "Name on your seed packet": "Naam op jou saadpakkie",
  "Leave blank if you have not chosen one. Timing remains the crop’s general guidance.": "Laat leeg as jy nie een gekies het nie. Tydsberekening bly die gewas se algemene riglyne.",
  "This legacy record can be kept or removed, but it cannot be rescheduled until a source-backed local duration is available.": "Hierdie ou rekord kan gehou of verwyder word, maar dit kan nie herskeduleer word totdat 'n bron-gestaafde plaaslike tydsduur beskikbaar is nie.",
  "Recorded sowing:": "Aangetekende saaiery:",
  "finish timing:": "klaarmaak-tydsberekening:",
  "confirm locally": "bevestig plaaslik",
  "Sow month": "Saaimaand",
  "Conservative harvest window": "Konserwatiewe oesvenster",
  "check/transplant when ready": "kontroleer/plant oor wanneer gereed",
  "Outside the usual sowing window for this region — still allowed.": "Buite die gewone saaivenster vir hierdie streek — steeds toegelaat.",
  "How much of the plot?": "Hoeveel van die perseel?",
  "How much of the bed?": "Hoeveel van die bedding?",
  "The whole plot — a staple plot grows one field crop at a time and rotates to a different botanical family in a later rotation, so there are no half-shares here.": "Die hele perseel — 'n stapelvoedselperseel kweek een veldgewas op 'n slag en wissel in 'n latere rotasie na 'n ander plantfamilie, so daar is geen halwe aandele hier nie.",
  "Split this bed (intercrop or stagger a succession)?": "Verdeel hierdie bedding (tussenplant of verspring 'n opvolging)?",
  "This plot is already carrying {clashes} — adding {crop} means they compete for the same ground, and a staple plot grows one field crop at a time. Still allowed.": "Hierdie perseel dra reeds {clashes} — om {crop} by te voeg, beteken dat hulle om dieselfde grond meeding, en 'n stapelvoedselperseel kweek een veldgewas op 'n slag. Steeds toegelaat.",
  "This bed is already carrying {clashes} — adding {crop} to the whole bed means they compete for the same ground. Still allowed.": "Hierdie bedding dra reeds {clashes} — om {crop} by die hele bedding te voeg, beteken dat hulle om dieselfde grond meeding. Steeds toegelaat.",
  "This bed is already carrying {clashes} — adding {crop} on top of that means they compete for the same ground. Still allowed.": "Hierdie bedding dra reeds {clashes} — om {crop} boonop by te voeg, beteken dat hulle om dieselfde grond meeding. Steeds toegelaat.",
  "{crop} in {span}": "{crop} in {span}",
  "(Together they need {n}% of the bed.)": "(Saam het hulle {n}% van die bedding nodig.)",
  "This plot has a legacy crop whose finish timing is not verified.": "Hierdie perseel het 'n ou gewas waarvan die klaarmaak-tydsberekening nie geverifieer is nie.",
  "This bed has a legacy crop whose finish timing is not verified.": "Hierdie bedding het 'n ou gewas waarvan die klaarmaak-tydsberekening nie geverifieer is nie.",
  "It is left out of the space check above; check that the ground is actually free before adding another crop.": "Dit word uit die spasiekontrole hierbo gelaat; kontroleer dat die grond werklik vry is voordat jy nog 'n gewas byvoeg.",
  "The app cannot tell whether it still holds this ground, so check that the ground is actually free before adding another crop.": "Die app kan nie sê of dit nog hierdie grond beset nie, so kontroleer dat die grond werklik vry is voordat jy nog 'n gewas byvoeg.",
  "This is already growing (not a new planting)": "Dit groei reeds (nie 'n nuwe plantery nie)",
  "{share} bed — intercropped": "{share} bedding — tussengeplant",
  "Sharing this bed with another crop at the same time. The kilogram comparison uses each crop's allocated area only; no generic intercropping bonus or penalty is invented.": "Deel hierdie bedding terselfdertyd met 'n ander gewas. Die kilogramvergelyking gebruik slegs elke gewas se toegewese oppervlakte; geen algemene tussenplant-bonus of -straf word uitgedink nie.",
  "Trays sown — not yet planted out": "Saadlaaie gesaai — nog nie uitgeplant nie",
